---
import ActionLink from "../components/ui/ActionLink.astro";
import Section from "../components/ui/Section.astro";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ExperienceItem from "../components/ExperienceItem.astro";
import { profile } from "../data/profile";
---

<Base title="About" description={profile.description}>
  <p class="eyebrow">
    Software Architecture · Technical Leadership · {profile.location}
  </p>

  <h1>Hi, I'm Mourad.</h1>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm a software engineer and technical lead based in Paris, with over a
      decade of experience building software, designing architectures, and
      helping engineering teams work more effectively.
    </p>

    <p>
      I've spent much of my career working on software for medical devices,
      where reliability, maintainability, and thoughtful engineering decisions
      really matter. I've also worked in climate technology, building product
      features that help companies better understand and manage their carbon
      emissions.
    </p>

    <p>
      Over the years, my focus has naturally evolved from writing application
      code to thinking about the bigger picture: how systems fit together, how
      teams collaborate, and how good engineering practices can make everyone's
      work easier.
    </p>

    <p>
      Today, I'm a Cross-Functional Technical Lead at Diagnostica Stago, where I
      returned in March 2025. I enjoy working at the intersection of
      architecture, hands-on engineering, and developer experience.
    </p>

    <h2>How I approach engineering</h2>

    <p>
      I believe good software architecture isn't about making things
      complicated. It's about making complexity manageable.
    </p>

    <p>
      I care about clear responsibilities, sensible abstractions, automated
      quality checks, and documenting the decisions that shape a system. Not
      because I enjoy adding rules, but because I've seen how much easier
      development becomes when teams have solid foundations to build on.
    </p>

    <p>
      I also believe technical leadership is about more than making
      architectural decisions. It's about listening, sharing knowledge,
      challenging ideas constructively, and helping other engineers grow.
    </p>

    <p>
      I still enjoy getting my hands into the code, understanding difficult
      problems, and finding practical solutions. For me, staying close to
      implementation is an important part of being an effective technical
      leader.
    </p>

    <p>
      Above all, I try to build software that's easier to understand, easier to
      change, and easier for the next developer to work with.
    </p>

    <ActionLink href={profile.resume} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      View résumé ↗
    </ActionLink>
  </div>

  <Section>
    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      From hands-on software development to architecture and cross-team
      technical leadership.
    </p>

    {profile.experience.map((experience) => (
      <ExperienceItem experience={experience} />
    ))}
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <h2>What I work with</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      The technologies, practices, and engineering disciplines I've worked with
      throughout my career.
    </p>

    {profile.expertise.map((item) => (
      <article class="card">
        <h3>{item.title}</h3>
        <p>{item.text}</p>
      </article>
    ))}
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <h2>Education</h2>
    {profile.education.map((item) => (
      <p>{item}</p>
    ))}
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <h2>Languages</h2>
    <ul>
      {profile.languages.map((item) => (
        <li>{item}</li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <h2>Let's connect</h2>
    <p>
      Interested in discussing software architecture, engineering practices, or
      sharing ideas? Feel free to reach out.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        GitHub ↗
      </a>
      {" · "}
      <a href={profile.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        LinkedIn ↗
      </a>
    </p>
  </Section>
</Base>
